        "then do the active recording for the next "
        "``active`` steps and then repeat the cycle "
        "starting with ``wait`` steps.\n"
        "The optional number of cycles is specified "
        "with the ``repeat`` parameter, the zero "
        "value means that\n"
        "the cycles will continue until the "
        "profiling is finished.\n"
