        "The ``skip_first_wait`` parameter controls "
        "whether the first ``wait`` stage should be "
        "skipped.\n"
        "This can be useful if a user wants to wait "
        "longer than ``skip_first`` between cycles, "
        "but not\n"
        "for the first profile. For example, if "
        "``skip_first`` is 10 and ``wait`` is 20, "
        "the first cycle will\n"
        "wait 10 + 20 = 30 steps before warmup if "
        "``skip_first_wait`` is zero, but will wait "
        "only 10\n"
        "steps if ``skip_first_wait`` is non-zero. "
